    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652660/extras/97e0fa4df8260370c1ac12cdd1c78a46.avif?t=1747163916\" data-has-big width=800 height=168 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Once upon a time in hell...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the zany and heartfelt\u00a0story of Maline, a kind devil girl from Hell who discovers the true power of Kindness one day by giving a generic demon a compliment... and the chance to truly make everyone friends! Is this a dream come true, or just another demonic swindle?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>\u2661 Find out in the\u00a0riveting, storybook-inspired adventure of &quot;Maline!&quot; \u2661</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VOLUME WARNING: This game can get loud!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652660/extras/7f9daa03440ad906e2849e80627c279a.avif?t=1747163916\" width=800 height=190 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Welcome to Maline!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game serves as the prequel to<i> SUPER UNDERWRLD</i>, the devilish action-adventure game currently in development! Dive into Hell and go on an adventure with the titular Devil girl, Maline, as she journeys across All Hells to find people to believe in her Kindness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created, written, directed, drawn, and scored by one person, this game was a labor of love - assisted by the power of friendship and a myriad of gorgeous voices!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's chock full of INCREDIBLE AMAZING FEATURES!!! THESE JUST <strong><i>SCRATCH THE SURFACE!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(pleasedontkillmeiknowthere'snogameplayimdoingmybestimmakinganewgamedontworrytheresasequelpleasepleasedontkillmeplease)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652660/extras/798781a74476efe1cdd259a3a7956a65.poster.avif?t=1747163916\" width=800 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652660/extras/798781a74476efe1cdd259a3a7956a65.webm?t=1747163916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652660/extras/798781a74476efe1cdd259a3a7956a65.mp4?t=1747163916\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>RIVETING GAMEPLAY!!!</u></i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All you need to do is hit the auto button to experience the most intense gameplay experience of your entire life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652660/extras/2e206c3213e7c964bdfed7efbdf21b7a.poster.avif?t=1747163916\" width=800 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652660/extras/2e206c3213e7c964bdfed7efbdf21b7a.webm?t=1747163916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652660/extras/2e206c3213e7c964bdfed7efbdf21b7a.mp4?t=1747163916\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>ANGSTY LESBIANS!!!!</u></i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LESBIANS?!?! WITH ANGST!?!?!? Do I even have to elaborate?!?!?!?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652660/extras/7ae6fd7d74cbf3da4fee76d3caaf4327.poster.avif?t=1747163916\" width=800 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652660/extras/7ae6fd7d74cbf3da4fee76d3caaf4327.webm?t=1747163916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652660/extras/7ae6fd7d74cbf3da4fee76d3caaf4327.mp4?t=1747163916\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>COSMIC DESTINY!!!!!</u></i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wow... so much resting on the cute little devil girl's shoulders.... Wowie... So much... Resting on her shoulders... So much resting on her shoulders... A deep, intriguing, original story straight from the mind of a robot idol to you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652660/extras/62b86e272ea60113c9819f9208c25839.avif?t=1747163916\" width=798 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>VTUBER VOICES!!!!</u></i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special thanks to the cast and crew of over 20 VTubers who lent their beautiful voices and talents to the project! From changelings, to robots, to genies, to just plain girls that like penguins, we have it ALL!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>NO AI USAGE!!!!</u></i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EVER.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Artist's Alley</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652660/extras/bc5391102283c3d884227e5cb4efcb0d.avif?t=1747163916\" data-has-big width=800 height=800 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>OFFICIAL SOUNDTRACK COVER BY KIKI ANTONETTE!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The official soundtrack by Ani Meida will be available on every streaming platform on the day of release!\u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652660/extras/dca11de1fa1eb46fc10462f965acb30c.avif?t=1747163916\" data-has-big width=800 height=1000 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Thank you to Dreizerel for the commemorative art! You can check out a speedpaint of this gorgeous piece on YouTube!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Believe in Kindness... And it'll find you wherever you are, even if you're in Hell!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
